Package: wiki.qaq.unfaird
Name: unfaird (iPhone 8)
Version: 0.1.15
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Asspp on-device IPA decrypt daemon for iPhone 8/8 Plus.
 Profile: iOS 16.2, Dopamine rootless, arm64, builtin libjailbreak process dump.
 Requires on device: OpenSSH, AppSync Unified, appinst, ElleKit and libjailbreak.dylib.
 Default policy: main-only extensions, batch size 2, 512 MB Jetsam limit.
Section: Utilities
Maintainer: LiBr <me@nvme0n1p.dev>
Author: LiBr <me@nvme0n1p.dev>
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
Provides: wiki.qaq.assppweb
Replaces: wiki.qaq.assppweb
